#. ~ Description of ".50 Beowulf XTP"
#: data/json/items/ammo/50_beowulf.json
msgid ""
".50-caliber Beowulf ammunition, loaded with a copper-jacketed 350-grain "
"eXtreme Terminal Performance bullet.  Developed in 2001 as a powerful short- "
"to medium-range chambering for AR-15 style rifles, this stout cartridge had "
"gained some popularity as a hunting round before the Cataclysm.  This "
"particular version of the cartridge is coated in a layer of polymer, "
"encouraging commendable terminal ballistics, penetrative capabilities, and "
"overall expansion from its 12.7x42mm projectile."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/50_beowulf.json
