#. ~ Description of ".50 Beowulf Xtreme Penetrator"
#: data/json/items/ammo/50_beowulf.json
msgid ""
".50-caliber Beowulf ammunition, loaded with a solid-copper 420-grain Xtreme "
"Penetrator bullet.  Developed in 2001 as a powerful short- to medium-range "
"chambering for AR-15 style rifles, this stout cartridge had gained some "
"popularity as a hunting round before the Cataclysm.  With a blunt nose "
"construction for better initial energy transfer, this 12.7mm-wide bullet's "
"solid copper design allows it to punch through entry barriers while resulting"
" in a larger wound column."
msgstr ""

