"A simple quiver made out of cloth that can be adjusted to hold various types "
"of arrows, bolts, and spears of different lengths.  Takes slightly longer to "
"pull ammunition from than a regular quiver.  Use insert to store arrows, "
"bolts, fishing spears, or atlatl spears."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tac vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"This light vest is meant to carry your magazines, shells and pistols.  They "
"are popular among law enforcement, but less so than combination tactical "
"vests incorporating Kevlar."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "breacher load bearing vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"This massive vest covered in MOLLE webbing is designed to attach a large "
"number of pouches, holsters and other PALS compatible accessories.  This one "
"has a single point sling wrapped around the shoulders using a system to keep "
"your weapon extra secure, as well as a set of strong magnets attached to the "
"torso and waist to hold a breaching shotgun."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tactical tool pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A low profile pouch designed to keep your tools accessible and secure.  Has "
"MOLLE straps for attaching to a vest or can be strapped directly to your "
"chest."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "flashlight pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A tiny pouch designed to keep your flashlight accessible and secure.  Has "
"MOLLE straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tactical holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy holster designed to be worn vertically, to keep a small profile on a"
" tactical vest.  This makes it a little more awkward to draw from than a "
"normal holster."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "gas mask pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A large pouch capable of holding a gas mask and an additional filter, keeping"
" both accessible and secure.  Has MOLLE straps for attaching to a belt or "
"vest."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "gas mask pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "The main compartment for a respirator."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "gas mask pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A side pocket for a single spare filter."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "gas mask pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "An internal divider pocket for some small accessories."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tactical grenade pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
